    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:24 PM",
      "text": "Have you seen Reed Garrett from TEX AAA-AA?"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:24 PM",
      "text": "Tigers took him in Rule 5"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Dick Egan",
      "time": "1:00 PM",
      "text": "I recommend him. He can make the club"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "1:01 PM",
      "text": "What’s his scouting report"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Dick Egan",
      "time": "1:03 PM",
      "text": "Mid high 90 fb, split like Chg, hard slurve SL. K’s. Agg Possibly late inn guy"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Dick Egan",
      "time": "1:04 PM",
      "text": "Mix that up if you write it. We are not supposed to talk to y’all"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "1:09 PM",
      "text": "Why do you hate me"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Dick Egan",
      "time": "1:10 PM",
      "text": "Al’s orders"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Dick Egan",
      "time": "1:10 PM",
      "text": "The press in general"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Dick Egan",
      "time": "1:11 PM",
      "text": "Only our bosses can leak info"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Dick Egan",
      "time": "1:12 PM",
      "text": "I saw your pre r-5 list. Didn’t have Chris Ellis on it either"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Dick Egan",
      "time": "1:13 PM",
      "text": "At least I don’t recall seeing him. He was taken too I think"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "1:14 PM",
      "text": "I’m not very Familiar with the guys"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "1:15 PM",
      "text": "And I’m just kidding about you hating me"
    }
  ]
}